# Base URL of the deployed feed proxy (Cloudflare Worker in `worker/`).
# Used at build time by Vite, so it must be set in the CI environment too
# (the deploy workflow reads it from the `VITE_FEED_PROXY` repository variable).
#
# Local development falls back to http://localhost:8787 (see `npm run worker:dev`).
# VITE_FEED_PROXY=https://canonni-feeds.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
